{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13443","headline":"奉和圣制次琼岳应制 · 韦济","name":"奉和圣制次琼岳应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陆海披晴雪，千旗猎早阳。\n岳临秦路险，河遶汉垣长。\n行漏通鳷鹊，离宫接建章。\n都门信宿近，歌舞从周王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}